

## 1. Create welcome.html

Create an HTML file named `welcome.html`, add a `<script>` tag, and display an alert with the message:

`Welcome to your Playlist Builder!`

when the page loads.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Welcome</title>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Playlist Builder</h1>

<script>
    alert("Welcome to your Playlist Builder!");
</script>

</body>
</html>
```

