## 5. Show Greeting using addEventListener()

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Greeting</title>
</head>
<body>

<button>Show Greeting</button>

<script>

const btn = document.querySelector("button");

btn.addEventListener("click", function () {
    alert("Hello from JS!");
});

</script>

</body>
</html>
```

