## 4. const Array Example

```javascript
const favoriteSongs = [
    "Kesariya",
    "Perfect",
    "Believer"
];

favoriteSongs.push("Shape of You");

console.log(favoriteSongs);

// const prevents reassignment of the variable,
// but the contents of the array can still be modified.
```

