## 8. Dynamic Typing

```javascript
function showProfile(name, followers, isPremium) {

    console.log(typeof followers);

    followers = "One Thousand";
    console.log(typeof followers);

    followers = 1000;
    console.log(typeof followers);
}

showProfile("Bhargav", 1000, true);
```

Output:

```
number
string
number
```

